  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "license": "UNLICENSED",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Browser worker outside the agent VM (G6a): typed browser operations over a substrate-agnostic seam, the human-control-mode primitive, and the pure decisions that gate them. The worker is the only CDP client of its Chromium, over a pipe.",
